<title>USA: MMI Cos Inc in $35.6 mln stock offering.</title>
<headline>MMI Cos Inc in $35.6 mln stock offering.</headline>
<dateline>DEERFIELD, Ill. 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>MMI Cos Inc said Friday it expects to raise $35.6 million from a 2.5 million share stock offering priced at $30-1/4 a share.</p>
<p>The company said it is offering 1.25 million of the shares and 1.26 million are being sold by stock holders.</p>
<p>The proceeds will be used for general corporate purposes, inclduing support of increased premium writings and to fund possible acqusitions, the company said.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
